Test 2: [Interval[start=1, end=10]]
Test 3: [Interval[start=1, end=4], Interval[start=5, end=7]]
Test 4: [Interval[start=1, end=5]]
Test 5: [Interval[start=1, end=2]]
Test 6: []
Test 7: [Interval[start=1, end=5]]
```

